OL,3,GNEWSAThe millennials swapping
OL,4,Adoom-scrolling for gardening
OL,5,
OL,6,FHannah, a former English teacher with
OL,7,Fmore than 70,000 followers on Instagram
OL,8,Fand TikTok, said the gardening
OL,9,Fcommunity was "booming" and represented
OL,10,Fa way of "recapturing some space that
OL,11,Ffeels less tense" on social media
OL,12,Fplatforms.
